**Problem:** Identical block structures (Hero → Purpose → Construction → Specs → Advantages → CTA) hardcoded with different text/images. Any UI change requires editing 8+ files.

### Block Type Taxonomy (Extracted)

| Block Type | Data Shape | Occurrence |
|------------|-----------|------------|
| `HERO` | badge, heading, description, ctaText, stats[{value,label}], imageUrl, imageAlt | Every page (Top) |
| `PURPOSE` | heading, bodyText, features[{title,description}] | Every page |
| `CONSTRUCTION` | icon, heading, paragraphs[] | Every page |
| `MODULES` | heading, items[{title,description}], footerText | Most pages |
| `TECH_SPECS` | heading, specs[] (string list) | Every page |
| `ADVANTAGES` | heading, items[] (string list) | Every page |
| `COMPLETENESS` | heading, items[] (string list) | Most pages |
| `INSTALLATION` | heading, items[] (string list) | Most pages |
| `RELATED_PRODUCTS` | heading, products[{href,title,description}] | Every page |
| `CTA` | heading, bodyText, orderItems[], buttons[{text,variant}] | Every page |
| `FAQ` | items[{question,answer}] | Some pages (ShityEtazhnye, Nakladky) |
| `GALLERY` | images[{src,alt}] or beforeAfter pairs | Some pages |
| `RICH_TEXT` | html content (markdown/raw) | Flexible filler |

---

## Proposed Prisma Schema

```prisma
model LandingPage {
  id             Int            @id @default(autoincrement())
  slug           String         @unique
  title          String
  titleSeo       String?
  descriptionSeo String?        @db.Text
  ogImageUrl     String?
  jsonLdType     String?        @default("Product")
  categoryId     Int?
  category       Category?      @relation(fields: [categoryId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)
  status         LandingStatus  @default(DRAFT)
  blocks         LandingBlock[]

  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt

  @@index([slug, status])
  @@map("landingpage")
}

model LandingBlock {
  id            Int           @id @default(autoincrement())
  landingPageId Int
  landingPage   LandingPage   @relation(fields: [landingPageId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  type          BlockType
  content       Json
  sortOrder     Int           @default(0)
  visibility    Boolean       @default(true)

  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt

  @@index([landingPageId, sortOrder])
  @@map("landingblock")
}

enum LandingStatus {
  DRAFT
  PUBLISHED
  ARCHIVED
}

enum BlockType {
  HERO
  PURPOSE
  CONSTRUCTION
  MODULES
  TECH_SPECS
  ADVANTAGES
  COMPLETENESS
  INSTALLATION
  RELATED_PRODUCTS
  CTA
  FAQ
  GALLERY
  RICH_TEXT
}
```

### Safety Guarantees

- **Non-destructive:** Two new tables only. Zero modifications to existing `product`, `category`, `order`, or any other model
- **Optional link:** `categoryId` on [LandingPage](file:///d:/PRODACTION/electroshitpro/next-tw/app/%28main%29/landing/test/page.jsx#91-95) is nullable — pages can exist independently of the product catalog
- **Cascade delete:** Deleting a [LandingPage](file:///d:/PRODACTION/electroshitpro/next-tw/app/%28main%29/landing/test/page.jsx#91-95) cascades to its blocks; deleting a [Category](file:///d:/PRODACTION/electroshitpro/next-tw/app/%28main%29/catalog/%5Bslug%5D/page.jsx#142-293) sets `categoryId` to null (no orphaned pages)
- **JSON content:** Each `BlockType` has its own JSON schema (validated at the backend layer via Zod, not at the DB level)

