## Phased Rollout

| Phase | Agent | Scope |
|-------|-------|-------|
| **1 (current)** | db-agent | Prisma schema + migration |
| 2 | backend-agent | Seed script extracting data from 8 JSX files into LandingPage+LandingBlock rows |
| 3 | backend-agent | Dynamic route handler `app/(main)/landing/[slug]/page.jsx` fetching from DB |
| 4 | ui-agent | Block factory components (`HeroBlock`, `SpecsBlock`, etc.) following Sovereign Industrial |
| 5 | qa-agent | Verify all 9 landing URLs render identical content from DB vs. old hardcoded files |
